{"id":"vod_sn_37665","vodId":"37665","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"夜樱四重奏","name_cn":"夜樱四重奏","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1c2b34cdec3494d2a219bdc2dcfdb61a.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为樱新小镇之中，在这里，人类和妖怪在和平的表象之下共同生活着。然而，盛开的樱花带来的是危机的预兆，越来越多的妖怪出现在这里，人类和妖怪的世界也开始产生融合。为了应对这场危机，“比泉生活协商事务所”的成员们挺身而出。　　开朗乐观，充满了正义感的枪樱姬（福圆美里 配音）、稳重可靠，个性温和的比泉秋名（梶裕贵 配音）、单纯可爱，乖巧懂事的七海蓝（藤田咲 配音）、好爽大方，能够使用言灵的五十音言叶（泽城美雪 饰），在伙伴们的帮助和扶持之下，他们需要面对的不仅仅是接连出现的突发状况，还有隐藏在小镇之中，复杂而又纠葛的权利纷争。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6LJwizSKkV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DuquXPN4Zz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LG9J9ruc3v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zexVVRCsWV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rzq5Mnevqd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wARjKRz1d51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Cmjrz1Paej1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8Naupg6T961/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mjx339iiQP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/apBLWLbWr01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P5VCD70ku51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WXWu1C7acL1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:08.016Z"}